Rodin Essential — Kotlin + Jetpack Compose rewrite (rodin-mt6899)

This repository is an independent source rewrite of the application interface of
"Rodin Essential" (https://github.com/NEESCHAL-3/Rodin-Essential), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The privileged Rust daemon (rodin_essentiald), its AOSP/KernelSU integration,
and every hardware-control operation it owns are used unmodified. No daemon
source is redistributed in this repository.
